---
import BookingPage from "../components/BookingPage.astro";
import BookingCaseCard from "../components/BookingCaseCard.astro";
---

<BookingPage
  title="Orientation Call"
  tidycal="dogoodagency/orientation-call"
  robots="noindex"
  seoTitle="Orientation Call | DoGood Agency"
  description="A short call to get oriented, clarify fit and timing, and choose the right next step (or a clear “not now”). Not a free consult, audit, or strategy build-out."
  canonical="https://www.dogoodagency.co/orientation"
>
  <p>This call serves two purposes.</p>

  <p>
    <span class="bk-n bk-pink">1.</span> A short, neutral chat to get oriented and choose <strong>the right next step with or without DoGood</strong>.
  </p>

  <p>
    <span class="bk-n bk-pink">2.</span> Provides current coaching clients with ad-hoc support between sessions. (WhatsApp preferred)
  </p>

  <p class="bk-label bk-tight">Know what you want?</p>
  <p>Re-route below to find more specific DoGood services.</p>

  <div class="bk-route">
    <p>
      <span class="bk-n bk-pink">1.</span> For founders who successfully exited, got bought out or otherwise meaningfully stepped back. FRP begins with <strong>Stage 1: The Reset (30 days)</strong>.
    </p>
    <div class="bk-btn-row">
      <a class="btn-apply" href="/apply-stage-1">Apply for Stage 1</a>
    </div>

    <p>
      <span class="bk-n bk-pink">2.</span> Founders with <strong>$300k+ ARR</strong> seeking clarity through 1:1 coaching (non-FRP) to sharpen business, leadership and life.
    </p>
    <div class="bk-btn-row">
      <a class="btn-apply" href="/clarity">Weekly 1:1 Clarity Sprints</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="bk-label bk-tight">Still want to book the Orientation Call?</p>
  <p>Choose a date and time below.</p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <BookingCaseCard />
  </Fragment>
</BookingPage>
